&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:11pt;padding-right:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;1.３社による製品開発、用途開発に関する業務提携&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:11pt;padding-right:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;2.ミヨシ油脂㈱の第三者割当増資引受に関する資本提携&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
